{"id":"n71116-4-8","stage":1,"title":"서비스 · 发球","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71116-4-8-1","ko":"이번엔 내가 서비스를 넣을 차례지?","zh":"这次轮到我发球了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번엔","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번엔","audio":"/audio/eae819c16fe222c8b75e.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"서비스를","meaning":"发球","explanation":"서비스：发球；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"서비스","audio":"/audio/06aff97f69dc060dd759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71116","senseId":"4","lemma":"서비스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서비스를","audio":"/audio/2f1c326c1f6a99bae528.mp3"}},{"text":"넣을","meaning":"发球（서비스를 넣다 的固定搭配）","explanation":"넣다：发球（서비스를 넣다 的固定搭配）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣을","audio":"/audio/e5bba9305284ac42aae8.mp3"}},{"text":"차례지?","meaning":"顺序，次序","explanation":"차례：顺序，次序；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"차례","audio":"/audio/e9fa78157c623c88645e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62410","senseId":"2","lemma":"차례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차례지","audio":"/audio/e012d104d567faae15a2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryI